OL,3,GNEWSA'We need help for small
OL,4,Abusinesses, not punishment'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We need more help for small businesses
OL,7,Finstead of punishing them," said
OL,8,Fbutcher Kevin Evans, in response to the
OL,9,Fgovernment's new tax and spending
OL,10,Fplans.
OL,12,FIn the Budget, set out by Chancellor
OL,13,FJohn Healey on Wednesday, a number of
OL,14,Fmeasures were announced, including a
OL,15,Fone-off #100 payment for up to 20
OL,16,Fmillion households in council tax bands
OL,17,FA-D in England.
OL,19,FHowever, for those living and working
OL,20,Fin Bilston, Wolverhampton, not enough
OL,21,Fis being done to tackle the rising cost
OL,22,Fof living.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
